                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='Annual EV Sales Across Vehicle Categories&#10;&#10;This visualization compares annual electric vehicle sales across different vehicle categories. The results highlight differences in sales volume among two-wheelers, hatchbacks, SUVs, sedans, and other vehicle segments. These insights help identify important market segments and understand consumer demand, supporting manufacturers in making informed decisions about production, marketing, and business expansion.' captured-sheet='Annual EV Sales by Category' id='1' />
